    "数据与到期安心保障": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data Retention & Protection"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "データと期限切れ安心保障"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到期不删数据：所有历史打卡记录、AI 周复盘、植物成长值、名称及外观均永久保留，绝不会因会员到期而枯萎或死亡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No data deletion: all check-in history, AI reviews, plant growth values, names, and visuals are permanently kept and will never wither or disappear upon expiration."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期限切れ後もデータ保持：履歴、AI振り返り、植物の成長値・名前・外観はすべて永久保存され、会員期限切れで枯れたり消えたりすることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卡片智能保留：到期后自动保留成长等级最高（或最近互动）的 1 张卡片继续使用，其余卡片完整冻结保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Smart card retention: the highest-level (or most recently interacted) card is automatically kept active, while other cards are safely frozen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カードの自動保持：期限切れ後は成長レベルが最も高い（または最近操作した）1枚のカードを引き続き利用可能にし、残りのカードは安全に保持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "庭院平滑过渡：到期后庭院展示最近互动的 2 株植物；重新订阅即可立刻按原有数据完整恢复展示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Smooth garden transition: after expiration, the garden shows your 2 most recent plants; resubscribing immediately restores all plants."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "庭園の移行：期限切れ後は直近の2株を表示。再登録ですべての植物が元のデータで即座に復活します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
